s: Nigerian and Pakistani. Each person has one.\n\nConstraint 1: Pakistani is adjacent to videographer → since videographer is in position 1, adjacent is only position 2. So Pakistani must be in position 2.\n\nTherefore:\n\n- Position 2: Nationality = Pakistani  \n- Position 1: Nationality = Nigerian  \n\nLet’s check all constraints:\n\n- Pakistani (pos 2) is adjacent to videographer (pos 1) → ✅  \n- Videographer (pos 1) is to the left of animation watcher (pos 2) → ✅  \n- All attributes unique → ✅  \n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n1. **What is the job of the person who is Pakistani?**  \n   Pakistani is in position 2 → job = freelancer\n\n2. **What is the movie genre of the person who is Pakistani?**  \n   Pakistani is in position 2 → movie genre = animation\n\n3. **What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?**  \n   Position 1 → thriller\n\n4. **At what position is the person who is a videographer?**  \n   Position 1\n\nSo answers in order:\n\n1. freelancer  \n2. animation  \n3. thriller  \n4. 1  \n\nFinal answer format:\n\n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>  \nFinal answer: freelancer, animation, thriller, 1", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.12692900002002716}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.023355737328529358}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -1.1368725299835205}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.57867431640625}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.4854746460914612}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -7.390948667307384e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0023353227879852057}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.005285219289362431}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -1.1920922133867862e-06}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0009191579301841557}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.05062822625041008}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.04045407474040985}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.01816658489406109}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ")", "logpro